        "note_tweet": {
          "entities": {},
          "text": "I've never commented before.  I bought all your books. I've sat and quietly disagreed with so much you've stood for for such a long time. I honestly don't understand why you are so vocal about people who just want to live their lives. You have such a voice and platform. But you choose to villyfy people who just want to live their own lives. Yes I understand some of your valid points about sports and prisons. Not everything is addressed by law. But the majority of trans people that you vilify are just normal law abiding persons who want to just exist without hate or persecution.  You use your platform for hate. Which is so wrong. I get that you think you are protecting women. But you could still protect women without demonising a whole community. You should do better."
        },
